      objectReference: {fileID: 2100000, guid: e63289acce8192f418271a318edafc31, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 1948507903827483940, guid: ab3dfa854d6c4194e9703c59d0e678a2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageBodies.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1948507903827483940, guid: ab3dfa854d6c4194e9703c59d0e678a2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageTitles.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1948507903827483940, guid: ab3dfa854d6c4194e9703c59d0e678a2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageBodies.Array.data[0]
      value: 'Since the structure of the scattering object entirely determines the
        scattering''s momentum distribution, particles with a range of initial velocities
        can be simulated together.

        <br><br>Controls:

        <b>Pulse particles:</b>
        When active, particles are emitted periodically in bunches. The pulse width
        can be set from 0.1 to 2.0 seconds.



        <b>Speed Range:</b> Randomizes
        the average particle speed up to +/- 50%.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1948507903827483940, guid: ab3dfa854d6c4194e9703c59d0e678a2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageBodies.Array.data[1]
      value: "<size=110%>\u6563\u4E71\u30AA\u30D6\u30B8\u30A7\u30AF\u30C8\u306E\u69CB\u9020\u304C\u6563\u4E71\u306E\u904B\u52D5\u91CF\u5206\u5E03\u3092\u5B8C\u5168\u306B\u6C7A\u5B9A\u3059\u308B\u305F\u3081\u3001\u69D8\u3005\u306A\u521D\u671F\u901F\u5EA6\u3092\u6301\u3064\u30D1\u30FC\u30C6\u30A3\u30AF\u30EB\u3092\u307E\u3068\u3081\u3066\u30B7\u30DF\u30E5\u30EC\u30FC\u30C8\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002\r\n<br><br>\u30B3\u30F3\u30C8\u30ED\u30FC\u30EB:\r\n<b>\u30D1\u30EB\u30B9\u30D1\u30FC\u30C6\u30A3\u30AF\u30EB:</b>
        \u6709\u52B9\u306B\u3059\u308B\u3068\u3001\u30D1\u30FC\u30C6\u30A3\u30AF\u30EB\u304C\u5B9A\u671F\u7684\u306B\u675F\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u653E\u51FA\u3055\u308C\u307E\u3059\u3002\u30D1\u30EB\u30B9\u5E45\u306F0.1\u79D2\u304B\u30892.0\u79D2\u307E\u3067\u8A2D\u5B9A\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002\r\n\r\n<b>\u901F\u5EA6\u7BC4\u56F2:</b>
        \u30D1\u30FC\u30C6\u30A3\u30AF\u30EB\u306E\u5E73\u5747\u901F\u5EA6\u3092\u6700\u5927+/-
        50%\u306E\u7BC4\u56F2\u3067\u30E9\u30F3\u30C0\u30E0\u5316\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1948507903827483940, guid: ab3dfa854d6c4194e9703c59d0e678a2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageBodies.Array.data[2]
      value: "<size=110%>\u7531\u65BC\u6563\u5C04\u9AD4\u7684\u7D50\u69CB\u5B8C\u5168\u6C7A\u5B9A\u4E86\u6563\u5C04\u7684\u52D5\u91CF\u5206\u4F48\uFF0C\u56E0\u6B64\u53EF\u4EE5\u540C\u6642\u6A21\u64EC\u5177\u6709\u4E0D\u540C\u521D\u59CB\u901F\u5EA6\u7684\u7C92\u5B50\u3002\r\n\r\n<br><br>\u63A7\u5236\u9078\u9805\uFF1A\r\n\r\n<b>\u8108\u885D\u7C92\u5B50\uFF1A</b>\u555F\u7528\u5F8C\uFF0C\u7C92\u5B50\u5C07\u4EE5\u8108\u885D\u675F\u7684\u5F62\u5F0F\u9031\u671F\u6027\u5730\u767C\u5C04\u3002\u8108\u885D\u5BEC\u5EA6\u53EF\u8A2D\u5B9A\u70BA
        0.1 \u81F3 2.0 \u79D2\u3002\r\n\r\n<b>\u901F\u5EA6\u7BC4\u570D\uFF1A</b>\u5C07\u5E73\u5747\u7C92\u5B50\u901F\u5EA6\u96A8\u6A5F\u5316\uFF0C\u7BC4\u570D\u70BA
        +/- 50%\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1948507903827483940, guid: ab3dfa854d6c4194e9703c59d0e678a2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageBodies.Array.data[3]
      value: "<size=110%>\u7531\u4E8E\u6563\u5C04\u4F53\u7684\u7ED3\u6784\u5B8C\u5168\u51B3\u5B9A\u4E86\u6563\u5C04\u7684\u52A8\u91CF\u5206\u5E03\uFF0C\u56E0\u6B64\u53EF\u4EE5\u540C\u65F6\u6A21\u62DF\u5177\u6709\u4E0D\u540C\u521D\u59CB\u901F\u5EA6\u7684\u7C92\u5B50\u3002\r\n\r\n<br><br>\u63A7\u5236\u9009\u9879\uFF1A\r\n\r\n<b>\u8109\u51B2\u7C92\u5B50\uFF1A</b>\u542F\u7528\u540E\uFF0C\u7C92\u5B50\u5C06\u4EE5\u8109\u51B2\u675F\u7684\u5F62\u5F0F\u5468\u671F\u6027\u5730\u53D1\u5C04\u3002\u8109\u51B2\u5BBD\u5EA6\u53EF\u8BBE\u7F6E\u4E3A
        0.1 \u81F3 2.0 \u79D2\u3002\r\n\r\n<b>\u901F\u5EA6\u8303\u56F4\uFF1A</b>\u5C06\u5E73\u5747\u7C92\u5B50\u901F\u5EA6\u968F\u673A\u5316\uFF0C\u8303\u56F4\u4E3A
        +/- 50%\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1948507903827483940, guid: ab3dfa854d6c4194e9703c59d0e678a2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageBodies.Array.data[4]
      value: "<size=110%>\uC0B0\uB780 \uBB3C\uCCB4\uC758 \uAD6C\uC870\uAC00 \uC0B0\uB780\uC758
        \uC6B4\uB3D9\uB7C9 \uBD84\uD3EC\uB97C \uC644\uC804\uD788 \uACB0\uC815\uD558\uAE30
        \uB54C\uBB38\uC5D0, \uB2E4\uC591\uD55C \uCD08\uAE30 \uC18D\uB3C4\uB97C \uAC00\uC9C4
        \uC785\uC790\uB4E4\uC744 \uD568\uAED8 \uC2DC\uBBAC\uB808\uC774\uC158\uD560
        \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.\r\n\r\n<br><br>\uC81C\uC5B4:\r\n<b>\uD384\uC2A4
        \uC785\uC790:</b> \uD65C\uC131\uD654\uB418\uBA74 \uC785\uC790\uAC00 \uC8FC\uAE30\uC801\uC73C\uB85C
        \uBB49\uCCD0\uC11C \uBC29\uCD9C\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uD384\uC2A4 \uD3ED\uC740
        0.1\uCD08\uC5D0\uC11C 2.0\uCD08\uAE4C\uC9C0 \uC124\uC815\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.\r\n\r\n<b>\uC18D\uB3C4
        \uBC94\uC704:</b> \uD3C9\uADE0 \uC785\uC790 \uC18D\uB3C4\uB97C \xB150%\uAE4C\uC9C0
        \uBB34\uC791\uC704\uB85C \uC124\uC815\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1948507903827483940, guid: ab3dfa854d6c4194e9703c59d0e678a2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageBodies.Array.data[5]
      value: "Como a estrutura do objeto dispersor determina completamente a distribui\xE7\xE3o
        do momento da dispers\xE3o, part\xEDculas com uma gama de velocidades iniciais
        podem ser simuladas em conjunto.\r\n<br><br>Controles:\r\n<b>Part\xEDculas
        de pulso:</b> Quando ativo, as part\xEDculas s\xE3o emitidas periodicamente
        em feixes. A largura do pulso pode ser definida de 0,1 a 2,0 segundos.\r\n\r\n<b>Faixa
        de velocidade:</b> Aleatoriza a velocidade m\xE9dia das part\xEDculas em
        at\xE9 +/- 50%."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1948507903827483940, guid: ab3dfa854d6c4194e9703c59d0e678a2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageBodies.Array.data[6]
      value: "La structure de l'objet diffusant d\xE9termine enti\xE8rement la distribution
        de l'impulsion diffus\xE9e\_; il est donc possible de simuler simultan\xE9ment
        des particules ayant diff\xE9rentes vitesses initiales.\r\n\r\n<br><br>Commandes\_:\r\n\r<b>Impulsions
        de particules\_:</b> Lorsqu'elle est activ\xE9e, cette option \xE9met des
        particules p\xE9riodiquement par paquets. La dur\xE9e des impulsions est
        r\xE9glable de 0,1 \xE0 2,0\_secondes.\r\n\r\n<b>Plage de vitesses\_:</b>
        Permet de varier al\xE9atoirement la vitesse moyenne des particules jusqu'\xE0
        +/-\_50\_%."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1948507903827483940, guid: ab3dfa854d6c4194e9703c59d0e678a2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageTitles.Array.data[5]
      value: "Faixa de velocidade e emiss\xE3o pulsada"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1948507903827483940, guid: ab3dfa854d6c4194e9703c59d0e678a2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageTitles.Array.data[6]
      value: "Plage de vitesse et \xE9mission puls\xE9e"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
