--- !u!1001 &3735733753166861106
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1293616846630547059}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 1714936211839288020, guid: b35325d7cd37e344c8ab453d729752e3,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageBodies.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1714936211839288020, guid: b35325d7cd37e344c8ab453d729752e3,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageTitles.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1714936211839288020, guid: b35325d7cd37e344c8ab453d729752e3,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageBodies.Array.data[0]
      value: 'This feature displays an overlay of the particle probability density
        on the detection screen.



        The relative probability of a particle
        arriving at a point on the screen is determined by a ray-tracing technique
        that traces rays back through the apertures and sums the portions of the
        2D scattering function that could contribute to a particle arriving at that
        point.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1714936211839288020, guid: b35325d7cd37e344c8ab453d729752e3,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageBodies.Array.data[1]
      value: "<size=110%>\u3053\u306E\u6A5F\u80FD\u306F\u3001\u691C\u51FA\u753B\u9762\u306B\u7C92\u5B50\u306E\u78BA\u7387\u5BC6\u5EA6\u3092\u91CD\u306D\u3066\u8868\u793A\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002\r\n\r\n\u753B\u9762\u4E0A\u306E\u70B9\u306B\u7C92\u5B50\u304C\u5230\u9054\u3059\u308B\u76F8\u5BFE\u7684\u306A\u78BA\u7387\u306F\u3001\u5149\u7DDA\u8FFD\u8DE1\u6280\u8853\u306B\u3088\u3063\u3066\u6C7A\u5B9A\u3055\u308C\u307E\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306E\u6280\u8853\u3067\u306F\u3001\u958B\u53E3\u90E8\u3092\u901A\u904E\u3059\u308B\u5149\u7DDA\u3092\u8FFD\u8DE1\u3057\u3001\u7C92\u5B50\u304C\u305D\u306E\u70B9\u306B\u5230\u9054\u3059\u308B\u306E\u306B\u5BC4\u4E0E\u3059\u308B\u53EF\u80FD\u6027\u306E\u3042\u308B2\u6B21\u5143\u6563\u4E71\u95A2\u6570\u306E\u90E8\u5206\u3092\u5408\u8A08\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1714936211839288020, guid: b35325d7cd37e344c8ab453d729752e3,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageBodies.Array.data[2]
      value: "<size=110%>\u6B64\u529F\u80FD\u6703\u5728\u63A2\u6E2C\u87A2\u5E55\u4E0A\u758A\u52A0\u986F\u793A\u7C92\u5B50\u6A5F\u7387\u5BC6\u5EA6\u3002\r\n\r\n\u7C92\u5B50\u5230\u9054\u87A2\u5E55\u4E0A\u67D0\u4E00\u9EDE\u7684\u76F8\u5C0D\u6A5F\u7387\u662F\u900F\u904E\u5149\u7DDA\u8FFD\u8E64\u6280\u8853\u78BA\u5B9A\u7684\u3002\u8A72\u6280\u8853\u8FFD\u8E64\u7A7F\u904E\u5B54\u5F91\u7684\u5149\u7DDA\uFF0C\u4E26\u5C07\u4E8C\u7DAD\u6563\u5C04\u51FD\u6578\u4E2D\u53EF\u80FD\u5C0E\u81F4\u7C92\u5B50\u5230\u9054\u8A72\u9EDE\u7684\u90E8\u5206\u76F8\u52A0\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1714936211839288020, guid: b35325d7cd37e344c8ab453d729752e3,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageBodies.Array.data[3]
      value: "<size=110%>\u6B64\u529F\u80FD\u4F1A\u5728\u63A2\u6D4B\u5C4F\u5E55\u4E0A\u53E0\u52A0\u663E\u793A\u7C92\u5B50\u6982\u7387\u5BC6\u5EA6\u3002\r\n\r\n\u7C92\u5B50\u5230\u8FBE\u5C4F\u5E55\u4E0A\u67D0\u4E00\u70B9\u7684\u76F8\u5BF9\u6982\u7387\u662F\u901A\u8FC7\u5149\u7EBF\u8FFD\u8E2A\u6280\u672F\u786E\u5B9A\u7684\u3002\u8BE5\u6280\u672F\u8FFD\u8E2A\u7A7F\u8FC7\u5B54\u5F84\u7684\u5149\u7EBF\uFF0C\u5E76\u5C06\u4E8C\u7EF4\u6563\u5C04\u51FD\u6570\u4E2D\u53EF\u80FD\u5BFC\u81F4\u7C92\u5B50\u5230\u8FBE\u8BE5\u70B9\u7684\u90E8\u5206\u76F8\u52A0\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1714936211839288020, guid: b35325d7cd37e344c8ab453d729752e3,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageBodies.Array.data[4]
      value: "<size=110%>\uC774 \uAE30\uB2A5\uC740 \uAC80\uCD9C \uD654\uBA74\uC5D0
        \uC785\uC790 \uD655\uB960 \uBC00\uB3C4 \uD568\uC218\uB97C \uACB9\uCCD0\uC11C
        \uD45C\uC2DC\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4.\r\n\r\n\uD654\uBA74\uC758 \uD2B9\uC815 \uC9C0\uC810\uC5D0
        \uC785\uC790\uAC00 \uB3C4\uB2EC\uD560 \uC0C1\uB300\uC801 \uD655\uB960\uC740
        \uAD11\uC120 \uCD94\uC801 \uAE30\uBC95\uC744 \uD1B5\uD574 \uACB0\uC815\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC774 \uAE30\uBC95\uC740 \uC870\uB9AC\uAC1C\uB97C \uD1B5\uACFC\uD558\uB294
        \uAD11\uC120\uC744 \uC5ED\uCD94\uC801\uD558\uACE0, \uD574\uB2F9 \uC9C0\uC810\uC5D0
        \uC785\uC790\uAC00 \uB3C4\uB2EC\uD558\uB294 \uB370 \uAE30\uC5EC\uD560 \uC218
        \uC788\uB294 2\uCC28\uC6D0 \uC0B0\uB780 \uD568\uC218\uC758 \uAC01 \uBD80\uBD84\uC744
        \uD569\uC0B0\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1714936211839288020, guid: b35325d7cd37e344c8ab453d729752e3,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageBodies.Array.data[5]
      value: "Este recurso exibe uma sobreposi\xE7\xE3o da densidade de probabilidade
        de part\xEDculas na tela de detec\xE7\xE3o.\r\n\r\nA probabilidade relativa
        de uma part\xEDcula chegar a um ponto na tela \xE9 determinada por uma t\xE9cnica
        de tra\xE7ado de raios que rastreia os raios atrav\xE9s das aberturas e soma
        as por\xE7\xF5es da fun\xE7\xE3o de espalhamento 2D que poderiam contribuir
        para a chegada de uma part\xEDcula naquele ponto."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1714936211839288020, guid: b35325d7cd37e344c8ab453d729752e3,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageBodies.Array.data[6]
      value: "Cette fonction affiche une superposition de la densit\xE9 de probabilit\xE9
        des particules sur l'\xE9cran de d\xE9tection.\r\n\r\nLa probabilit\xE9 relative
        qu'une particule atteigne un point donn\xE9 de l'\xE9cran est d\xE9termin\xE9e
        par une technique de trac\xE9 de rayons qui simule la propagation des rayons
        \xE0 travers les ouvertures et somme les contributions de la fonction de
        diffusion 2D susceptibles d'expliquer l'arriv\xE9e d'une particule \xE0 ce
        point."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1714936211839288020, guid: b35325d7cd37e344c8ab453d729752e3,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageTitles.Array.data[6]
      value: "Densit\xE9 de probabilit\xE9 de position"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
